# Question 05 :
Write CSS rules to style all <h2> elements inside a <section> with a blue
color and center alignment.

# Answer 05 :
To style all <h2> elements inside a <section>, we use a descendant selector in CSS. This selector targets only the <h2> tags that are inside the <section> element.

    section h2 {
        color: blue;
        text-align: center;
    }


